before:
Group the schema change and version update in a transaction.
```sql
BEGIN;
ALTER TABLE tasks ADD COLUMN archived INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0;
PRAGMA user_version = 2;
COMMIT;
```

after:
```sql
CREATE TABLE tasks(id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, title TEXT NOT NULL);
INSERT INTO tasks VALUES (1, 'Read');
PRAGMA user_version = 1;
BEGIN;
ALTER TABLE tasks ADD COLUMN archived INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0;
PRAGMA user_version = 2;
COMMIT;
SELECT id, title, archived FROM tasks;
PRAGMA user_version;
```
The saved task remains 1, Read, with archived set to 0. The version is now 2.
